Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.35,0:00:02.45,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a battle!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真是一场苦战！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.25,0:00:06.73,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}5{\fs68}号下午 中网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:09.82,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}郑钦文本届第三次打进决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:11.94,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}这场近三小时的硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.94,0:00:13.88,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}她怎样拿下来？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:27.55,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Good put away from Zheng.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文这一下收得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.55,0:00:30.55,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And just like that, breaks at love.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就这样 连下四分完成破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:32.50,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}高压收掉开局这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.44,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}郑钦文随后{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:36.45,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}后却被追平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.52,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}官方集锦未完整收录这段过程
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:42.67,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}抢七{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}后 她连拿四分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.95,0:01:02.85,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it drops in!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 这球落在界内！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:06.41,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So the first set goes to Zheng Qinwen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘归郑钦文！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:08.93,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Coach likes that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N教练很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.93,0:01:10.37,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Crowd certainly likes it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N观众当然也很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.89,0:01:13.89,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Now confirmed that that ball did drop in.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在确认了 这球确实落在界内
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:16.91,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Extra cheer from the crowd in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N北京现场又响起一阵欢呼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:21.53,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So four last points won by Zheng in the tiebreak.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文拿下了抢七最后四分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:24.63,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}盘点这记正手打向边线空当
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.68,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}对手追不到 郑钦文拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:30.38,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}但第二盘 她{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:34.01,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}官方集锦没有完整收录这段丢分过程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.35,0:01:44.15,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So, breaks back, does Zheng.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文完成回破
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:46.99,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's one of the breaks back that she lost.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她追回了此前丢掉的一次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.57,0:02:00.71,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, beautiful shot from Zheng there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 郑钦文这一拍真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:03.30,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}郑钦文追回到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:06.53,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}但布兹科娃的盘点 还是来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.21,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Off to a third set we will go.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛进入决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.11,0:02:25.03,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Second straight match on this court today,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天这块场地连续第二场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:27.99,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that three sets is needed to decide a winner.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N都要打满三盘才能决出胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.61,0:02:32.91,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Zheng Qinwen winning the opening set in the tiebreak.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文通过抢七拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.91,0:02:36.07,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Bouzkova coming back to win the second, 6-4.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布兹科娃以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}扳回第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:41.37,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}到了决胜盘 郑钦文没有送出破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.37,0:02:43.06,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}先把自己的发球局守住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:45.64,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}机会还要在一拍一拍里争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:05.51,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a really good service game from Zheng that time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文这一局发球局打得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:17.63,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a point!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 多精彩的一分！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:37.37,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a point!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 多精彩的一分！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:38.81,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Point of the match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这就是全场最佳一分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:41.35,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Marie Bouzkova comes away with it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布兹科娃拿下这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:44.85,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 郑钦文从{\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}打到平分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:47.23,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}仍守住发球局 随后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:48.97,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}第一个赛点被救
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.97,0:03:52.36,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}官方集锦没有收录这两段完整过程
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:54.81,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}再一次机会 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:03.65,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it goes long!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球出界了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:07.09,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it's Zheng Qinwen who gets it done!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文赢下了这场比赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.09,0:04:09.51,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the crowd is loving it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现场观众沸腾了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:11.65,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Her coach pleased as well.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的教练也很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:12.65,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Pere Riba.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N佩雷 里巴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.43,0:04:14.53,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a battle!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N真是一场苦战！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:19.33,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Bouzkova up for the challenge.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布兹科娃迎战到底
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:24.13,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Final break of serve is the deciding moment,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后这次破发决定了胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:28.17,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as Zheng Qinwen in front of her home Chinese crowd.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文站在中国主场观众面前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:31.75,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Big smile and almost a little bit of a dance there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N笑容灿烂 几乎要跳起舞来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.55,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Seven-six, four-six, seven-five.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:37.31,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Two hours, 54 minutes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2{\fs68}小时{\fs78}54{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:39.83,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a win for Zheng Qinwen,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文拿下一场精彩的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.89,0:04:41.71,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who's through to the fourth round in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N晋级北京站第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:47.65,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Certainly pleased with what they saw from Zheng Qinwen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大家显然很满意郑钦文今天的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:50.21,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fs78}11{\fs68}个{\fs78}ACE{\fs68} {\fs78}56{\fs68}记制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:52.71,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}也有{\fs78}33{\fs68}次非受迫失误
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:55.12,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}进攻有威力 赢下这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.60,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}还得把最后的机会抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.93,0:05:00.09,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}郑钦文闯进{\fs78}16{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.02,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}下一轮面对恰拉耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:05.25,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}她能继续向前 打进八强吗？
